WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Have you or someone you know been diagnosed with TDS?

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.300
The symptoms can be relentless.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.480
Fortunately, I'm Dr. Trump, and I have a treatment plan.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.640
Let's hear what some of my patients have to say.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.180
I have been suffering for over a decade,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:18.240
and after listening to Dr. Trump, I can see some results.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.780
Man, I've been suffering for years.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.760
I really didn't believe that was help out there.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.440
That was when I came across this video on TV.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.300
I really thought I was a lost cause.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.040
This was going to affect me for the rest of my life.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.920
But after using the treatment plan, I can see a difference.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.080
I really wasn't sure I could help some of these people.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.180
They were so far gone, I wasn't really sure.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.920
I had no idea how much this was affecting my life.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.320
My work is slowed down.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.740
I'm hardly recognizable anymore.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:07.720
I just needed help. I couldn't eat. I couldn't sleep. Constantly angry. I made everyone miserable around me.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:19.500
I feel like I've aged 20 years in the last two years. I've been so concerned I was really starting to worry about my future.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.420
The treatment is simple

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:22.420
Turn off

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.520
Fake news

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.720
Say your prayers

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:25.960
And if you ever feel anxious

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.540
Just have a Diet Coke like me

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.820
And you're going to see a remarkable difference in your life
